<title>USA: P &amp; F Q3 says won't sustain revs in Q4.</title>
<headline>P &amp; F Q3 says won't sustain revs in Q4.</headline>
<dateline>FARMINGDALE, N.Y. 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>P &amp; F Industries Inc said on Monday it did not expect to sustain third quarter revenues and net income in the fourth quarter, but second half net income should still exceed the same period last year.</p>
<p>The company said its sales patterns were sometimes irregular and third quarter revenue growth, which increased 30.4 percent ot $13.0 million, might not be matched in the fourth quarter.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
